  // The West Province (plan 34 · PD6, its first session): north out of Cortondo through the basin where the Quaking Earth
  // Titan charges about into Asado Desert, north again to Cascarrafa by its falls, west from there down to Porto
  // Marinada on the western sea, and east out of the desert along the West Province's first area, past the gully where
  // the Open Sky Titan keeps its ledge, to Medali. Our own land, from public descriptions of the places and memory of
  // play, nothing traced, laid out at PD1's and PD3's compressed distances (docs/mechanics/rulings.md, "The West
  // Province and the fourth and fifth gyms"). Read after titans.json (its name sorts after it), so its hills close the
  // stand-ins' old gullies and its floors cut the hills: the hills first, too steep to climb, then every way's and town's
  // floor. The bake keeps only the land the areas hold (world.json's bakeRing), so the hills' backs are never baked
  "brushes": [
